APRIL 25th 1979 - BATTERSEA PARK - MATCH -V- LAC etc.

A few brave souls battled through the April showers in this early season preliminary. Derrick Williams won the 100m but lost his duel in the 200m, while Pat Lyttle just missed out in the Youths 100m by 0.1 second. David North produced a very good early season run in the 3000m and Peter St.Ange jumped 13 cms further than his effort on April 14th.

