MARCH 14th 1979 - CRYSTAL PALACE - SCAAA 10kms CHAMPIONSHIP.

On a cold evening those who braved the conditions saw Gordon Vale of Surrey leave Carl Lawton standing as he broke the British Junior Record with 44m.41.6. In the closing stages Belgrave's Richard Dorman failed by 20 seconds to collect a championship medal.

